[{"answer":"Hi Jake.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-3-2024-06-22-00-24-51/1_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"How are you getting on with the practical teaching?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-3-2024-06-22-00-24-51/2_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Ah... it's harder than I expected, but I've got some great classes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-3-2024-06-22-00-24-51/3_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"How about you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-3-2024-06-22-00-24-51/4_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Not brilliant.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-3-2024-06-22-00-24-51/5_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm really struggling with my Year 12 science class.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-3-2024-06-22-00-24-51/6_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Are they hard to control?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-3-2024-06-22-00-24-51/7_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I don't have discipline problems as such.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-3-2024-06-22-00-24-51/8_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"It's just that they don't seem to think that science has anything to do with their lives.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-3-2024-06-22-00-24-51/9_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"It's depressing.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-3-2024-06-22-00-24-51/10_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"They listen to what I say,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-3-2024-06-22-00-24-51/11_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"and I gave them a test last week and the results weren't too bad,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-3-2024-06-22-00-24-51/12_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"but there's no real engagement.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-3-2024-06-22-00-24-51/13_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-3-2024-06-22-00-24-51/14_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"And as part of my teaching practice, I have to design an experiment for them to do.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-3-2024-06-22-00-24-51/15_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"I was wondering about something on the children's diets...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-3-2024-06-22-00-24-51/16_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"You know, asking them to record what they eat and maybe linking it to their state of health.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-3-2024-06-22-00-24-51/17_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Mmm. Let's think.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-3-2024-06-22-00-24-51/18_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"So your methodology would involve the children recording what they eat.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-3-2024-06-22-00-24-51/19_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay, but you'd also need to have access to the children's medical records","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-3-2024-06-22-00-24-51/20_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"and I don't think people would be happy about that;","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-3-2024-06-22-00-24-51/21_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"confidentiality would be an issue.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-3-2024-06-22-00-24-51/22_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"If you could get the right data, the conclusions might be significant,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-3-2024-06-22-00-24-51/23_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"but I suspect it's not going to be easy.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-3-2024-06-22-00-24-51/24_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-3-2024-06-22-00-24-51/25_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Have you thought about doing an experiment using animals?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-3-2024-06-22-00-24-51/26_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Wouldn't that be upsetting for the children?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-3-2024-06-22-00-24-51/27_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, the animals don't have to be harmed in any way.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-3-2024-06-22-00-24-51/28_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"It could just be an experiment where they're given a certain diet and the effects are observed.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-3-2024-06-22-00-24-51/29_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Would I have to get permission to use animals?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-3-2024-06-22-00-24-51/30_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, you'd have to submit an outline of the experiment and fill in a form,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-3-2024-06-22-00-24-51/31_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"but it's quite straightforward.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-3-2024-06-22-00-24-51/32_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"But if we found out that, say, a particular diet affects the health of animals,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-3-2024-06-22-00-24-51/33_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"the same thing wouldn't necessarily be true for people, would it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-3-2024-06-22-00-24-51/34_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"No, that's true,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-3-2024-06-22-00-24-51/35_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"but the findings for any experiment are going to be limited.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-3-2024-06-22-00-24-51/36_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"It's inevitable.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-3-2024-06-22-00-24-51/37_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"I suppose so.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-3-2024-06-22-00-24-51/38_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"So what animals could I use to investigate the effects of diet?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-3-2024-06-22-00-24-51/39_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Mice?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-3-2024-06-22-00-24-51/40_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-3-2024-06-22-00-24-51/41_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"You'd need experimental mice - ones that have been specially bred for experiments.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-3-2024-06-22-00-24-51/42_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay, so what will your experiment be investigating exactly?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-3-2024-06-22-00-24-51/43_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, something to do with nutrition.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-3-2024-06-22-00-24-51/44_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"So maybe we could look at food supplements...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-3-2024-06-22-00-24-51/45_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Things like extra iron and extra protein, and their impact on health.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-3-2024-06-22-00-24-51/46_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Mmm. That might be rather broad.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-3-2024-06-22-00-24-51/47_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Maybe just look at the effects of one supplement, like sugar, on the health of the mice?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-3-2024-06-22-00-24-51/48_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"In fact, maybe the focus could be on whether mice can control their own diet.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-3-2024-06-22-00-24-51/49_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"So, what happens when they have access to more sugar that they don't really need?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-3-2024-06-22-00-24-51/50_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Exactly.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-3-2024-06-22-00-24-51/51_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Do they eat it or do they decide to leave it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-3-2024-06-22-00-24-51/52_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Great.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-3-2024-06-22-00-24-51/53_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Then later on, you could do a follow-up experiment adding another variable.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-3-2024-06-22-00-24-51/54_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Like, you could give some of the mice the chance to be more active,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-3-2024-06-22-00-24-51/55_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"running on a wheel or something,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-3-2024-06-22-00-24-51/56_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"and the others just sit around and don't do much.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-3-2024-06-22-00-24-51/57_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Or I could repeat the experiment but change the type of food I provided...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-3-2024-06-22-00-24-51/58_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"or use mice with a different genetic structure.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-3-2024-06-22-00-24-51/59_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"But I think your idea would be more interesting,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-3-2024-06-22-00-24-51/60_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"I might think about that some more.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-3-2024-06-22-00-24-51/61_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"So can I talk through a possible procedure for the experiment where mice are given a sugar supplement?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-3-2024-06-22-00-24-51/62_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Sure.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-3-2024-06-22-00-24-51/63_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"I did a similar experiment in college actually.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-3-2024-06-22-00-24-51/64_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Great.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-3-2024-06-22-00-24-51/65_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"So how many mice would I need?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-3-2024-06-22-00-24-51/66_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"I'd say about 12.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-3-2024-06-22-00-24-51/67_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"And all young ones, not a mixture of old and young.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-3-2024-06-22-00-24-51/68_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-3-2024-06-22-00-24-51/69_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"And I'd need two groups of equal sizes, so six in each group.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-3-2024-06-22-00-24-51/70_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"And how would I tell them apart?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-3-2024-06-22-00-24-51/71_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"I suppose I could put some sort of tag on one group... or just mark them in some way?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-3-2024-06-22-00-24-51/72_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"You could use food colouring, that wouldn't hurt them.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-3-2024-06-22-00-24-51/73_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Perfect.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-3-2024-06-22-00-24-51/74_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Then each group would go into a separate cage,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-3-2024-06-22-00-24-51/75_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"and one group, let's call them group A, would be the control group.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-3-2024-06-22-00-24-51/76_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"So they'd just have ordinary mouse food.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-3-2024-06-22-00-24-51/77_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"I suppose you can buy that?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-3-2024-06-22-00-24-51/78_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, it comes in dry pellets.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-3-2024-06-22-00-24-51/79_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"And the other group would have the same as the first group,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-3-2024-06-22-00-24-51/80_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"but they'd also have the extra sugar.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-3-2024-06-22-00-24-51/81_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Would you just give them straight sugar?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-3-2024-06-22-00-24-51/82_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"It might be better to give them something like cereal with it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-3-2024-06-22-00-24-51/83_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Mmm. Then you'd need to weigh the mice, I should think once a week.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-3-2024-06-22-00-24-51/84_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"And you'd need an electronic balance.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-3-2024-06-22-00-24-51/85_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"But we can't hold them on the balance, or it'd affect the reading.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-3-2024-06-22-00-24-51/86_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Exactly.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-3-2024-06-22-00-24-51/87_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"So you need something called a weighing chamber to stop the mice from running away.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-3-2024-06-22-00-24-51/88_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"It sounds complicated, but actually you can just use a plastic box with holes in the top.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-3-2024-06-22-00-24-51/89_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-3-2024-06-22-00-24-51/90_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"So once we've measured the weight gain of each mouse","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-3-2024-06-22-00-24-51/91_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"we can work out the average for each group, as well as the standard deviation.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-3-2024-06-22-00-24-51/92_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"And then see where we go from there.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-3-2024-06-22-00-24-51/93_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"That sounds cool!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-3-2024-06-22-00-24-51/94_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"I think the students will enjoy it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-3-2024-06-22-00-24-51/95_v3.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes. One thing...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam19-test-3-part-3-2024-06-22-00-24-51/96_v3.mp3"}]
